each formula it moves back by its text, so a plain formula that reads a range
where one value goes (=B3:B4*2) turns into a dynamic array that spills.
Put back: relines writes the formulas it moved with setFormula, which reads
the kind off the text, not putBack, which keeps the kind each had.

